# The saved reference pages under docs/ keep their `_files/` asset directories,
# bundles included, so each one still opens offline. None of it is reproducible:
# the storyboard sits behind auth and the console mock is a preview deployment,
# so a .gitignore that trimmed the bundles would leave an unopenable reference.
